This project uses Espressif ESP-IDF, Waveshare board support components and LVGL.
These upstream projects and their respective contributors retain their copyrights.
The repository references these dependencies rather than vendoring the SDK.

This is an independent community project. OpenAI, Codex, Espressif and Waveshare
names identify compatible products; no affiliation or endorsement is claimed.

This directory does ship one prebuilt binary: codex_air_remote-merged.bin, the merged
flash image of this repository's own firmware (sources in the repository's firmware/
directory, Apache License 2.0). It is bundled so the plugin can flash a board without
a toolchain; see manifest.json for its version, size and sha256.

No OpenAI desktop application, model, virtual audio driver or private credentials are
included in this package.
